---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Programmes - Effective Altruism Durham"
  description="Explore our seminar programmes aimed to help you think about how you can have a positive impact on the world, including the Arête Fellowship and In-Depth EA (IDEA) Fellowship."
>
  <SiteHeader />

  <main
    class="relative min-h-screen bg-cover bg-center bg-fixed bg-no-repeat"
    style="background-image: url('/assets/shared/page-hero-bg.jpg');"
  >
    <!-- Semi-transparent cream overlay to align with the EA brand theme and ensure readability -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#f4efe9]/85 backdrop-blur-[2px]"></div>

    <!-- Content container -->
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-[980px] px-5 py-16 md:py-24">
      
      <!-- Page Title -->
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h1
          class="font-ea-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal tracking-[0.25em] text-[#054d5a] uppercase mb-4"
        >
          Programmes
        </h1>
        <div class="mx-auto h-[3px] w-24 bg-[#0c869b]"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Programmes Sections Stack -->
      <div class="space-y-12">
        
        <!-- Arête Fellowship Card -->
        <div
          class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 md:p-12 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30 group"
        >
          <h2
            class="font-ea-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-[#054d5a] mb-6 tracking-wide"
          >
            Arête Fellowship
          </h2>
          
          <p
            class="font-ea-body text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#404040] mb-8"
          >
            The Arête Fellowship is an eight-week seminar programme aimed to help you think about how you can have a positive impact on the world. Each week, fellows will read, think about and discuss key ideas and concepts from a range of disciplines related to doing good effectively.
          </p>

          <div>
            <a
              href="/arete-fellowship"
              class="group inline-flex h-[54px] w-[268px] items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
              style="background-color: #68246d;"
              onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
              onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
            >
              <span>Read more</span>
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 60 60"
                class="h-4 w-4 fill-current transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path
                  d="M46.5 28.9L20.6 3c-.6-.6-1.6-.6-2.2 0l-4.8 4.8c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l19.8 20-19.9 19.9c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l4.8 4.8c.6.6 1.6.6 2.2 0l21-21 4.8-4.8c.8-.6.8-1.6.2-2.2z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- In-Depth EA (IDEA) Fellowship Card -->
        <div
          class="bg-white/95 border border-[#e8dfd3] rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 md:p-12 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#0c869b]/30 group"
        >
          <h2
            class="font-ea-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-[#054d5a] mb-6 tracking-wide"
          >
            In-Depth EA (IDEA) Fellowship
          </h2>
          
          <p
            class="font-ea-body text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#404040] mb-8"
          >
            The IDEA (In-Depth EA) Fellowship is open to everybody who has completed the Arête Fellowship. It’s an eight-week programme, beginning with two weeks of setting intentions and thinking about our own values and how we arrive at them, followed by 6 weeks where your fellowship group decides together which topics to cover.
          </p>

          <div>
            <a
              href="/idea-fellowship"
              class="group inline-flex h-[54px] w-[268px] items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-[5px] text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
              style="background-color: #68246d;"
              onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#541d58'"
              onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#68246d'"
            >
              <span>Read more</span>
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 60 60"
                class="h-4 w-4 fill-current transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path
                  d="M46.5 28.9L20.6 3c-.6-.6-1.6-.6-2.2 0l-4.8 4.8c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l19.8 20-19.9 19.9c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l4.8 4.8c.6.6 1.6.6 2.2 0l21-21 4.8-4.8c.8-.6.8-1.6.2-2.2z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
